OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Apowers together, Xi says as Trump
OL,5,Atoasts friendship at state dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump welcomed
OL,8,FChina President Xi Jinping to the White
OL,9,FHouse for a lavish state dinner where
OL,10,Fboth leaders touted a new chapter in
OL,11,Ftheir friendship.
OL,13,FThe dinner was attended by billionaire
OL,14,Fbusiness leaders, Trump administration
OL,15,Fofficials, US tech CEOs and others.
OL,16,FTheir arrival was marked, however, by
OL,17,Fprotesters loudly shouting from just
OL,18,Foutside the White House gates, some of
OL,19,Fwhom were arrested.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
